refactor(cloud-functions): harden security, restructure codebases, and enhance export

- Require Firebase Auth on all cloud functions (receipt analysis + export)
- Fix formula injection in spreadsheet export (sanitize =, +, -, @ prefixes)
- Add decompression bomb guard (10 MB limit) and cap decimalPlaces
- Remove unused verifyGoogleToken and verifyAppleToken functions
- Split TS and Python into separate Firebase codebases (functions/ + functions-py/)
- Add Firestore write for export recovery when background worker is killed
- Add subcategory breakdown and pivot summary (months as columns) for single-tab export
- Add custom spreadsheet title support
- Add unit tests for Python cloud function (41 tests)
- Add API contract spec and update deploy docs
